Package: conmon
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: OCI container runtime monitor
 conmon is the container monitor used by Podman and CRI-O: it watches the
 primary process of the container, handles logging, and reports the exit code.
